{'symbol': 'FAST', 'date': '2020-01-17 10:30:00', 'title': 'FASTENAL POSTS Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $0.31', 'text': 'MPANY REPORTS 2019 ANNUAL AND FOURTH QUARTER EARNINGS.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.31.Q4 SALES ROSE 3.7 PERCENT.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.31 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY NET SALES $1,276.9 MILLION VERSUS $1,231.6 MILLION.Q4 REVENUE VIEW $1.29 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.GENERAL SLOWING IN ECONOMIC ACTIVITY THAT CO EXPERIENCED IN Q2, Q3 OF 2019 CONTINUED IN Q4 OF 2019.GENERAL SOFTNESS WAS EXACERBATED IN DECEMBER BY HOLIDAY TIMING AND LONGER THAN USUAL YEAR-END PLANT SHUTDOWNS.FASTENAL - EXPECT NET CAPITAL EXPENDITURES IN 2020 TO BE WITHIN A RANGE OF $180 MILLION TO $205 MILLION, A DECREASE FROM $195 MILLION TO $225 MILLION IN 2019.'}